  "idea": "Zapier transfer tool for bulk migrating legacy spreadsheet data",
  "text": "Here is how to map data fields and run historical migrations with zero technical stress. Most teams delay switching to Airtable because moving years of customer spreadsheets feels completely overwhelming. Standard import wizards fail when handling custom date formats, linked records, and multi-select tags. Zapier Transfer lets you visually align historical columns, preview mapped records, and execute one-time migrations in bulk. You transition databases cleanly without losing client records.",
